# Token of the `demoflow-app` Cloudflare tunnel — its own tunnel, not a
# connector on another stack's. Zero Trust → Networks → Tunnels →
# demoflow-app → the token from the install command. Public hostname, set
# in the dashboard:
#
#   demoflow-app.luna-realm.com  →  HTTP  proxy:80
#
# The one value a person supplies by hand; keep a copy in
# ~/.demoflow/cloudflared.env (mode 600).
TUNNEL_TOKEN=
